  "notes": "Sri Kurmanathaswamy Temple in Srikurmam in July 2021, including the historic carved sanctum, connected halls, covered courtyard ranges, and precinct entrances within the mapped building. The detached tank pavilion, animal enclosure and interiors are outside this model. The building outlines and courtyard are mapped. Vertical dimensions and the division between the connected shrines are interpreted from the July 2021 photography.",
